# Bounded sequences on both sides of a service.
#
# The idiomatic-to-RMW conversion for a bounded sequence differs from an
# unbounded one (BoundedSequence::try_from, not Sequence::from). The service and
# action templates once got this wrong while the message template had it right,
# so both directions are exercised here.

geometry_msgs/Point[<=2] waypoints
string<=16 label
Collections collections
---
bool success
geometry_msgs/Point[<=2] resolved
string[<=3] notes
